        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CF-5631, Thin Rectangular Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 4-1/2 Inch Rectangular Flush Pull's simple design means that it is easy to clean, making it the perfect choice for high-traffic pocket doors. It It also easy to install with the included mounting screws. And since it is available in 6 finishes, you will find just the right one to match your decor.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CF-5631 Rectangular Flush Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 1-3/8\" (34 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 11/32\" (9 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\" (2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Opening Height: 3-5/16\" (84 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Opening Width: 29/32\" (23 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lip:  None</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height: 3-11/32\" (85 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Width: 1-1/16\" (27 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Screws: (2) #6 x 3/4\" wood screws.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
